# Regattaboot (M5, D-080): a racing dinghy, the Reisebus's machine on the lake.
# White hull w i with an S boot stripe, a tall white mainsail and jib w with
# h seams and i shading, a red R class emblem (a diamond, no letters), a thin
# d mast (masthead = row 4, the bounce top, nothing above it), an O boom.
# Two friendly sailors in S / Y life vests. Waterline = row 48; rows 49-63
# are only the dark hull bottom T, centreboard and rudder b (keel row 60).
# idle = parked, sail luffing (the leech flutters), crew sitting.
# telegraph = the start: the stern flag drops, crew hikes out, horn puff w.
# The flag is R w, not r w: with the S stripe and vests and the w hull, an
# r flag would break art-style §8 (only Resi has r + S + w).
# drive = heeled (top +2 px), full sail, crew hiking out, w bow wave left.
# Faces LEFT (bow left), no mirror: it only races left (like the bus).
# Built with a scratch script (shapes + automatic k outline), frozen here.
sprite = regattaboot
size   = 32x64
origin = 16,64
hitbox = 4,4,24,56
anim   = idle      frames=2 ticks=30 loop
anim   = telegraph frames=2 ticks=6 loop
anim   = drive     frames=2 ticks=4 loop
